            "custom_code": "",
            "title": "Disease-Risk Avoidance",
            "description": "<p>ATC does not use <em>Corylus avellana</em> → no EFB exposure path. <strong>Benefit:</strong> Your truffle trees will not be decimated by EFB, as many non-ATC truffle orchards have.</p>",
